WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.143
Uranus.

00:01.843 --> 00:07.095
Just too faint for most eyes, though binoculars will find it if you know where to look.

00:07.545 --> 00:10.891
It was the first planet discovered with a telescope.

00:11.341 --> 00:17.757
It lies on its side, so each pole has forty-two years of daylight and then forty-two of night.
